<view class="container">
  <view class="hero">
    <view class="title">我到底认识几个汉字</view>
    <view class="subtitle">从识形到通源，八级汉字能力自测 · 共 {{totalChars}} 字</view>
  </view>

  <view class="card">
    <view class="section-title">单字测级</view>
    <view class="muted">输入或随机选一个字，逐级挑战它的形、音、义、写、用、源。</view>
    <view class="char-input-row">
      <input
        class="char-input"
        value="{{charInput}}"
        maxlength="2"
        placeholder="输入一个汉字"
        bindinput="onCharInput"
      />
      <view class="random-btn" bindtap="randomChar">随机</view>
    </view>
    <view class="btn mt" bindtap="startSingle">开始测这个字</view>
  </view>

  <view class="card">
    <view class="section-title">整体自测</view>
    <view class="muted">按档位随机抽字，估算你的整体识字水平。</view>

    <view class="field-label">字库范围</view>
    <view class="chips">
      <view
        wx:for="{{scopes}}"
        wx:key="index"
        class="chip {{scopeIndex === item.index ? 'active' : ''}}"
        data-index="{{item.index}}"
        bindtap="selectScope"
      >{{item.name}} {{item.count}}</view>
    </view>

    <view class="field-label">抽样字数</view>
    <view class="chips">
      <view
        wx:for="{{sampleSizes}}"
        wx:key="*this"
        class="chip {{sampleSize === item ? 'active' : ''}}"
        data-size="{{item}}"
        bindtap="selectSize"
      >{{item}} 字</view>
    </view>

    <view class="btn mt" bindtap="startTest">开始自测</view>
  </view>

  <view class="card last" wx:if="{{lastResult}}">
    <view class="row between">
      <view>
        <view class="section-title last-title">上次成绩</view>
        <view class="muted">{{lastResult.scopeName}} · {{lastResult.count}} 字 · {{lastResult.dateText}}</view>
      </view>
      <view class="last-level">{{lastResult.avgLevelText}}</view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="footer">
    <view class="footer-link" bindtap="goIntro">等级说明</view>
    <view class="footer-dot">·</view>
    <view class="footer-link" bindtap="goHistory">历史记录</view>
  </view>
</view>
